expression: "help(&[verb])"
---
List the follow-ups a project's closed plans carry

Usage: mnemex follow-ups [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --for <DIR>          The directory whose project to ask about. Defaults to the working directory
      --project <PROJECT>  The project's id
      --json               Emit the versioned envelope
  -h, --help               Print help
